: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2011학년도 전기 교육대학원 학위수여예정자(2012. 02.&nbsp;17)&nbsp;중 부전공 과목을 이수한&nbsp;학생은 부전공 자격검정에 필요한 서류를 다음과 같이 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 19.2pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; 1. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 교원자격 무시험 검정원서 1부.(정부수입인지 500원권 첨부)</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 최종학기 성적증명서 1부.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 교원자격증(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">정교사 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2급</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원본</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 1부.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 제출기한 : 2012. 01. 04(수) ~ 01. 06(금)[3일간]</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: